 both an ATP-dependent DNA helicase and an ATP-dependent, dual-direction single-stranded exonuclease. Recognizes the chi site generating a DNA molecule suitable for the initiation of homologous recombination. The AddA nuclease domain is required for chi fragment generation;PD-(D/E)XK nuclease superfamily;PFAM UvrD REP helicase;UvrD REP helicase
